    "body": "### Reason for requesting the library\n\nDruid looks up a number of its own classes and resources by name at runtime, and the jar ships no native-image metadata. In a native image nothing throws and the pool still hands out connections, but logging, filters and part of the JMX view stop working:\n\n- `LogFactory` probes for a logging backend with `Resources.classForName` and takes the `(String)` constructor of `SLF4JImpl`, `Log4jImpl`, `Log4j2Impl` and so on. None of them are registered, so it falls through to `NoLoggingImpl`, which only prints errors to stderr.\n- `FilterManager` reads the filter aliases from `META-INF/druid-filter.properties` and creates filters with `Class.newInstance()`. The resource is not in the image, so `filters=stat` is taken as a class name and the filter is dropped. No SQL stats are collected.\n- `DruidDataSourceStatManager` registers itself as a standard MBean, but `DruidDataSourceStatManagerMBean` is not registered for reflection, so the `DruidDataSourceStat` MBean has no attributes.\n\nOn the JVM the program below prints:\n\n```\nlog impl: com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.SLF4JImpl\ndrivers: [com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriver, com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriver, org.h2.Driver]\n23:53:37.327 [main] INFO com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource -- {dataSource-1} inited\nfilters: [com.alibaba.druid.filter.stat.StatFilter]\ncount: 1\nsql stats: 3\nmbean DruidDataSource: 92 attributes\nmbean DruidDataSourceStat: 2 attributes\nmbean DruidDriver: 6 attributes\nmbean DruidStatService: 0 attributes\nmbean MockDriver: 6 attributes\n23:53:37.573 [main] INFO com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource -- {dataSource-1} closing ...\n23:53:37.575 [main] INFO com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource -- {dataSource-1} closed\n```\n\nAs a native image:\n\n```\nlog impl: com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.NoLoggingImpl\ndrivers: [com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriver, com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriver, org.h2.Driver]\ncom.alibaba.druid.filter.FilterManager : load filter error, filter not found : stat\nfilters: []\ncount: 1\nsql stats: 0\nmbean DruidDataSource: 92 attributes\nmbean DruidDataSourceStat: 0 attributes\nmbean DruidDriver: 6 attributes\nmbean DruidStatService: 0 attributes\nmbean MockDriver: 6 attributes\n```\n\nThe entries below come from the tracing agent in conditional mode with `com.alibaba.druid.**` as user code. I kept Druid's lookups of its own classes and resources plus the `org.slf4j.Logger` probe, and left out the JDK management beans and H2 entries that the agent also files under Druid classes. `MockDriver` is there because the druid jar lists it in `META-INF/services/java.sql.Driver` next to `DruidDriver`, so `DriverManager` loads it. With these entries the native output is the same as the JVM output. Only the slf4j backend and the `stat` filter were exercised. The other backends and filters are looked up the same way.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"reflection\": [\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.util.Utils\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.filter.stat.StatFilter\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.filter.FilterManager\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.filter.stat.StatFilter\",\n      \"methods\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"<init>\",\n          \"parameterTypes\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriver\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriver\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriver\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriverMBean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidAbstractDataSource\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidAbstractDataSource\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidDataSourceStatManager\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidDataSourceStatManager\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSourceMBean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidPooledConnection\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidPooledConnection\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriver\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriver\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriver\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriverMBean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidDataSourceStatManager\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidDataSourceStatManager\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidDataSourceStatManager\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidDataSourceStatManagerMBean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidStatService\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidStatService\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidStatService\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.DruidStatServiceMBean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.JdbcSqlStat\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.stat.JdbcSqlStat\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.Resources\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.SLF4JImpl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.LogFactory\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.SLF4JImpl\",\n      \"methods\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"<init>\",\n          \"parameterTypes\": [\n            \"java.lang.String\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.support.logging.Resources\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"org.slf4j.Logger\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"resources\": [\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.util.JdbcUtils\"\n      },\n      \"glob\": \"META-INF/druid-driver.properties\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.filter.FilterManager\"\n      },\n      \"glob\": \"META-INF/druid-filter.properties\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"condition\": {\n        \"typeReached\": \"com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource\"\n      },\n      \"glob\": \"META-INF/services/com.alibaba.druid.filter.Filter\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nTested on GraalVM CE 25.4.4.1.1 with Native Build Tools 1.1.13 and the metadata repository enabled. The program uses logback because `SLF4JImpl` refuses loggers that are not a `LocationAwareLogger`, and slf4j-simple's are not.\n\ndynamic-datasource ships a copy of Druid's metadata, which we would like to drop once Druid is covered here: https://github.com/baomidou/dynamic-datasource/tree/dfd8caada1a25269abbc379e7cb17d078a619c41/dynamic-datasource-native-metadata/src/main/resources/META-INF/native-image/com.alibaba/druid/1.2.27\n\nReproducer. `settings.gradle`:\n\n```groovy\nrootProject.name = 'druid-native-probe'\n```\n\n`build.gradle`:\n\n```groovy\nplugins {\n    id 'application'\n    id 'org.graalvm.buildtools.native' version '1.1.13'\n}\n\nrepositories {\n    mavenCentral()\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    implementation 'com.alibaba:druid:1.2.28'\n    implementation 'org.slf4j:slf4j-api:2.0.17'\n    implementation 'ch.qos.logback:logback-classic:1.5.20'\n    runtimeOnly 'com.h2database:h2:2.4.240'\n}\n\napplication {\n    mainClass = 'probe.Main'\n}\n\ngraalvmNative {\n    metadataRepository {\n        enabled = true\n    }\n}\n```\n\n`src/main/java/probe/Main.java`:\n\n```java\npackage probe;\n\nimport com.alibaba.dru\n...[truncated]",
